  "skip_reason": "Layer-A canonical drive of `fv3_kinetic_energy_cell` requires ESS `discretize` to dispatch four cubed_sphere face-stagger reads at the surrounding D-grid faces of CellCenter(i,j) — two u_edge reads at axis=ξ offsets {0, 1} and two v_edge reads at axis=η offsets {0, 1} — and to resolve the per-cell sub-grid metric bindings `sin_a` and `cos_a` (drawn from `sin_sg[$target, 5]` and `cos_sg[$target, 5]` at super-grid position 5 = cell center) into the closed-form bilinear `expression`. The cubed_sphere multi-axis read + sub-grid metric-binding extension is the same ESS blocker that holds `covariant_laplacian_cubed_sphere` and `transport_2d` Layer-A back today (see audit dsc-ztvz / F7). Once that extension lands, this stub can be replaced by a hand-pinned canonical contract that pins KE = (u_avg² + v_avg² − 2·u_avg·v_avg·cos α) / (2·sin²α) bit-for-bit against the imperative reference on a small cN cubed sphere with non-degenerate α (gnomonic equidistant α ≠ π/2).",
